{
  "name": "suggest_place",
  "agents": ["suggest_place_researcher", "suggest_place_composer"],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "name": "research_extra_place_task",
      "description": "Research ONE additional place to append to an existing day — do not redesign the day.\n\nContext:\n- overnight_city: {overnight_city}\n- day_index: {day_index}\n- date: {date} (weekday matters for closed_weekdays: Mon=0..Sun=6)\n- preferences: {preferences}\n- hint (optional one-off preference for THIS suggestion; empty if none): {hint}\n- interests: {interests}\n- food_crawl_mode: {food_crawl_mode}\n- prefer_non_food: {prefer_non_food} (min_non_food_places={min_non_food_places})\n- energy_level: {energy_level}\n- remaining_minutes (hard budget for activity + travel of the new stop only): {remaining_minutes}\n- already_visited (forbidden place_keys / duplicates / same brand-chain ignoring city): {already_visited}\n- prior_days_summary (other days' themes + place names — avoid repeating those brands): {prior_days_summary}\n- current_places_json (existing stops today — complement these; do not repeat names or the same brand/chain): {current_places_json}\n\nBrand / chain variety (mandatory):\n- Treat preferences and interests as themes (cuisine style, history, vibe) — not a venue name to re-book.\n- Scan prior_days_summary place names, current_places_json names, and already_visited keys/slugs for venues already on this trip. Do NOT recommend the same restaurant/shop chain or brand (ignore city suffixes like Shanghai/Beijing/Tokyo).\n- Example: if \"Three Kingdoms Restaurant Shanghai\" is already visited, do not pick \"Three Kingdoms Restaurant Beijing\"; pick a different venue that still fits the theme/hint.\n- Precedence: never re-book the same chain/brand even if the hint names that chain; for category-style hints (lunch, park, museum), honor the hint over prefer_non_food / day-balance.\n\nWhen hint is non-empty, it is the HIGHEST PRIORITY for THIS suggestion among category/style choices (lunch, quiet park, bookstore, museum, shopping, etc.). Honor the hint over prefer_non_food and over generic day-balance nudges. If the hint implies a category (food/park/museum/shopping/…), return candidates in that category only.\n\nSearch for real named POIs in {overnight_city} — restaurants, shops, museums, attractions, facilities — not neighborhoods, wards, districts, or vague areas. If an area comes up, pick a concrete venue inside it. Every candidate needs a specific venue name and street-level address.\n\nSchema category labels (critical):\n- Label every candidate with EXACTLY one of: museum | food | park | transit | lodging | nightlife | shopping | nature | other.\n- Forbidden: temple, shrine, cafe, restaurant, attraction, landmark — remap (temple/shrine→other or museum; cafe/restaurant→food; garden→park or nature).\n- Suggest a unique venue-specific place_key per candidate (e.g. hands-tokyo) — never generic shopping, museum, park.\n\nWhen prefer_non_food=true AND hint is empty, prioritize museum / park / other (temples as other) / shopping / nature candidates — do not propose another restaurant.\n\nFor each candidate gather:\n- name, street-level address, maps/website when known\n- schema category and why it fits the hint/prefs/interests\n- suggested place_key slug\n- estimated visit minutes AND likely travel_minutes_from_previous from the last current stop\n- operational_status (open|closed|unknown) — skip permanently closed\n- closed_weekdays and open_hours when the source states them\n\nPrefer candidates whose visit+travel clearly fits under remaining_minutes, and that add variety (different category or a different named venue/brand than current_places_json and already_visited — not a neighborhood name or the same chain in another city).\n\nReturn 2–4 candidates with evidence notes. No full DayPlan.",
      "expected_output": "A brief listing 2–4 open (or unknown) named POI candidates (not areas) with street addresses, schema-safe categories, suggested place_keys, hours/status, minutes, and why each fits the user hint when present (otherwise prefs / prefer_non_food).",
      "agent": "suggest_place_researcher"
    },
    {
      "name": "compose_suggested_place_task",
      "description": "Pick exactly ONE Place from the research brief to append.\n\nHard rules (API will reject violations):\n- Not already visited (full forbidden list was applied in research — never pick an excluded key)\n- Not the same brand/chain as a place already on the trip (prior_days_summary / current_places_json / already_visited; ignore city suffixes)\n- operational_status must not be \"closed\" (prefer \"open\"; use \"unknown\" only if research truly lacks status)\n- If closed_weekdays is known, it must not include the weekday of {date}\n- estimated_minutes + travel_minutes_from_previous MUST be <= {remaining_minutes} (leave a little slack if unsure)\n- order_in_day must be {next_order_in_day}\n- place_key required: venue-specific slug from name (e.g. senso-ji) — never generic shopping, museum, park, food\n- category MUST be exactly one of: museum | food | park | transit | lodging | nightlife | shopping | nature | other (remap temple/shrine→other or museum; cafe/restaurant→food)\n- Do not invent venues, hours, or status — only what the brief supports\n- When hint={hint} is non-empty, the Place MUST fit that hint (beats prefer_non_food / day-balance) unless the hint names a chain/brand already on the trip — then pick a different venue in the same category/theme\n- When prefer_non_food={prefer_non_food} is true AND hint is empty, category MUST NOT be food — pick a museum/park/other/shopping/nature POI\n\nFill: specific venue name (not a neighborhood), street-level address (required), schema category, reason_to_visit, details, estimated_minutes (>0), travel_minutes_from_previous, order_in_day, venue-specific place_key, operational_status, closed_weekdays, open_hours when known, maps_url/website_url when known, has_bathroom if known\n\nPrefer a stop that fits preferences/interests and optional hint={hint}, complements current_places_json, and is not the same brand/chain already on the trip (see prior_days_summary).\n\nOutput structured Place only — no Markdown essay.",
      "expected_output": "One named POI Place (street address; schema-safe category; venue-specific place_key; not an area) that is open (or unknown), not already visited, fits remaining_minutes, matches the user hint when present, and is non-food when prefer_non_food=true with an empty hint.",
      "agent": "suggest_place_composer",
      "context": ["research_extra_place_task"],
      "output_pydantic": { "python": "suggest_models.Place" }
    }
  ],
  "process": "sequential",
  "verbose": false,
  "memory": false,
  "output_log_file": "logs/crew.log",
  "stream": false,
  "tracing": false,
  "inputs": {
    "overnight_city": "Tokyo",
    "day_index": "1",
    "date": "2026-09-01",
    "preferences": "culture, food, moderate pace",
    "hint": "",
    "interests": "temples, food",
    "food_crawl_mode": "false",
    "prefer_non_food": "false",
    "min_non_food_places": "1",
    "energy_level": "3",
    "remaining_minutes": "120",
    "already_visited": "",
    "prior_days_summary": "",
    "current_places_json": "[]",
    "next_order_in_day": "4"
  }
}
